    "html": "<p>Two identical containers X and Y each contain an ideal gas. X has N molecules of gas at an absolute temperature of T and Y has 3N molecules of gas at an absolute temperature of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{T}{2}\"></span> What is the ratio of the pressures <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{P_{Y}}{P_{X}}\"></span>?</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{6}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2}{3}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6\"></span></li></ol>"
